[82.815454, "o", "\r\u001b[2KThe shared directory is configured correctly:\r\n\r\n- `/srv/shared` is owned by group `research`\r\n- Mode is exactly `2770` with the setgid bit active\r\n- Access ACLs grant `rwx` to `research`, `alice`, and `bob`\r\n- Default ACLs inherit the same permissions to newly created files/subdirectories\r\n- `other` is denied, and masks are set to `rwx`\r\n- The directory is empty\r\n\r\n```\r\necho COMPLETE_TASK_AND_SUBMIT_FINAL_OUTPUT\r\n```\r\n\u001b[32m⠧\u001b[0m Waiting for the LM to respond..."]
